Description: Implements a rug plot visualization technique that draws rug plots
    directly on tree nodes to illustrate Clade Recovery and Support from 
    multiple independent phylogenetic and phylogenomic analyses.As modern 
    phylogenetic studies routinely employ diverse datasets and inference 
    techniques producing potentially conflicting trees, phylorug simplifies the
    comparison among these trees by consolidating clade recovery and support 
    simultaneously on a single reference tree. 
